{"sha": "d48353d2049924588602feaf2f3b5f0e53069d4b3265cafc184f9181722d96ee", "body": ["{\\small 一球自由下落，一球同时水平射出：在", "每个时刻 $t_1$、$t_2$、$t_3$ 两球高度相同 --- 速率不造成任何延迟。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[下落的猴子]\\label{rem:g12:projectile-motion:monkey}", "动物园饲养员用飞镖\\emph{直接瞄准}一只猴子，猴子", "在射击时松开了树枝。这样无济于事：飞镖与猴子各自下落 $\\tfrac12 gt^2$，", "都低于各自无重力时的位置 --- 即瞄准线与树枝 --- 因此", "无论飞镖速率如何，二者恰好相遇", "（见\\cref{exo:g12:projectile-motion:15}）。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{完整地看抛物线}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[轨迹]\\label{thm:g12:projectile-motion:trajectory}", "消去 $t$：由 $x(t)$ 和 $y(t)$ 可知，抛体", "（$0 \\leq \\alpha < \\ang{90}$）的轨迹是开口向下的抛物线", "\\[", "y = x\\tan\\alpha \\;-\\; \\frac{g}{2 v_0^2 \\cos^2\\alpha}\\, x^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将 $t = x/(v_0\\cos\\alpha)$ 代入", "\\cref{thm:g12:projectile-motion:equations}中的 $y(t)$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[omExo] (-0.4,0) -- (8.7,0);", "  \\draw[thick] plot[domain=0:8, samples=60] (\\x,{1.08*\\x-0.135*\\x*\\x});", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (0,0) -- (0.75,0.81) node[above left] {$\\vect v_0$};", "  \\draw (0.7,0) arc (0:47:0.7); \\node at (1.0,0.26) {$\\alpha$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef] (2,1.62) -- ++(1.0,0);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp] (2,1.62) -- ++(0,0.54) node[left] {$\\vect v_y$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (2,1.62) -- ++(1.0,0.54) node[above] {$\\vect v$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (4,2.16) -- ++(1.0,0) node[above] {$\\vect v$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef] (6,1.62) -- ++(1.0,0) node[above right] {$\\vect v_x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp] (6,1.62) -- ++(0,-0.54);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (6,1.62) -- ++(1.0,-0.54) node[right] {$\\vect v$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, thick] (8.3,2.2) -- ++(0,-0.7) node[below] {$\\vect g$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 飞行过程中：$\\vect v_x$ 始终不变；", "$\\vect v_y$ 逐渐减小，在最高点为零，随后反向 --- 箭头倾斜，", "抛物线也随之变化。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[射程]\\label{def:g12:projectile-motion:range}", "对于平地上的抛体，\\emph{射程}\\index{射程} $R$ 是", "抛体回到发射高度时所经过的水平距离；", "\\emph{飞行时间}\\index{飞行时间} $t_f$ 即该段行程的时长。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[最高点、飞行时间与射程]\\label{prop:g12:projectile-motion:range}", "在平地上，$0 < \\alpha < \\ang{90}$ 时：", "\\[", "t_f = \\frac{2 v_0 \\sin\\alpha}{g}, \\qquad", "h_{\\text{最高点}} = \\frac{(v_0\\sin\\alpha)^2}{2g}", "\\ \\ \\text{ 到达于 } t_f/2, \\qquad", "R = \\frac{v_0^2 \\sin(2\\alpha)}{g}.", "\\]", "射程在 $\\alpha = \\ang{45}$ 时最大，此时 $R = v_0^2/g$；", "互余角 $\\alpha$ 与 $\\ang{90} - \\alpha$ 对应相同的射程。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "令 $y = 0$，得 $t\\,(v_0\\sin\\alpha - \\tfrac12 gt) = 0$：解得发射时刻与 $t_f$。", "最高点 $v_y = 0$ 位于 $t = v_0\\sin\\alpha/g = t_f/2$ 处，代入", "$y(t)$ 得最高点高度。于是 $R = x(t_f) = 2v_0^2\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\alpha/g =", "v_0^2\\sin(2\\alpha)/g$。正弦在 $2\\alpha = \\ang{90}$ 时最大，且", "$\\sin\\bigl(2(\\ang{90}-\\alpha)\\bigr) = \\sin(\\ang{180} - 2\\alpha) =", "\\sin(2\\alpha)$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.8cm, height=5.4cm,", "    xlabel={$x$ (\\unit{m})}, ylabel={$y$ (\\unit{m})},", "    xmin=0, xmax=10.8, ymin=0, ymax=5.4,", "    legend pos=north east, legend cell align=left]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:5.10] {x*tan(15) - 0.04905*x^2/cos(15)^2};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=0:8.83] {x*tan(30) - 0.04905*x^2/cos(30)^2};", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=0:10.19] {x*tan(45) - 0.04905*x^2/cos(45)^2};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, dashed, domain=0:8.83] {x*tan(60) - 0.04905*x^2/cos(60)^2};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, dashed, domain=0:5.10] {x*tan(75) - 0.04905*x^2/cos(75)^2};", "  \\legend{\\ang{15}, \\ang{30}, \\ang{45}, \\ang{60}, \\ang{75}}", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 发射速率相同，$v_0 = \\qty{10}{m/s}$，五个角度：\\ang{45}", "投得最远；两组角度（\\ang{15}、\\ang{75}）与（\\ang{30}、\\ang{60}）", "落点相同 --- 一组低平而快，一组高而慢。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[球门球]\\label{ex:g12:projectile-motion:kick}", "门将以 $v_0 = \\qty{25}{m/s}$，$\\alpha = \\ang{45}$ 开球：", "$R = 25^2/9.81 \\approx \\qty{64}{m}$；实际解围的落点更近", "\\qty{55}{m} 左右 --- 空气阻力使射程缩短。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[抛体问题的梳理]\\label{met:g12:projectile-motion:method}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 以发射点为原点建立坐标轴：$Ox$ 水平，$Oy$ 竖直向上；", "        写出 $\\vect v_0$ 的分量。", "  \\item 检验是否为自由落体（只受重力）：则 $\\vect a = (0,-g)$；", "        两次积分，每次都代入初始条件。", "  \\item 问\\emph{位置}时：消去 $t$（得轨迹）；问", "        \\emph{时刻}时：保留 $t$。", "  \\item 对照关系：最高点 $\\Leftrightarrow v_y = 0$；发射高度", "        $\\Leftrightarrow y = 0$；墙位于 $d \\Leftrightarrow x = d$ 处；地面", "        低于发射点 $\\ell$ 处 $\\Leftrightarrow y = -\\ell$。", "  \\item 检验：飞行关于最高点对称；$R \\leq v_0^2/g$；空气阻力", "        只会使射程变短。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}